# Patch-ID: P-TAB-001 / P-NAV-001 (wave 12, trusted navigation)
# Area: tab.
# Rationale: browser UI needs data/file and upstream settings/version WebUI;
#   retain an explicit trusted scheme policy and reject unaudited WebUI hosts.
#   view-source wraps only http(s)/file. Add ABI minor query without changing
#   Configure major or existing structure layouts.
# Last-Rebased: 2026-11-02 (Chromium 156.0.8078.74).
# Frozen-file exceptions: ABI header/adapter/version and export lists extend
#   the existing surface. SettingsUI assumes a tab AutofillClient; embedded
#   contents have none, so omit only controls requiring it, using upstream
#   settings for everything else. No TabFeatures/blanket-helper bypass.
# Validation: build-p29, build-p30 (attempt 2); smoke-tab019 G1-G5; native
#   core/services and URLs; nm-tab019 (38 exports). Tests use disposable profiles
#   and mock Keychain to avoid temporary executable identity authorization.

